{
"file": 475,
"paths": [
"d008/d024/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "69aa936a",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, a moment?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "49013f98",
"en_raw": "You're a middle schooler... 500 yen"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "7c96e9a5",
"en_raw": "What's so nice about"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "0955fc9d",
"en_raw": "my own ugly face"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "26a1bf61",
"en_raw": "having it drawn,"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "cdf7fa86",
"en_raw": "huh?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "c8fe6dd5",
"en_raw": "...Anything else?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "a4d0e6f4",
"en_raw": "...Then anything else?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d649f82c",
"en_raw": "Right, about this"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "bfec6ddd",
"en_raw": "I want to know more"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2b391241",
"en_raw": "Is that a dried"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "7e0829ef",
"en_raw": "animal paw?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "46227f80",
"en_raw": "If you want vulgar goods like that"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "51488f81",
"en_raw": "the stall over there has them"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "8f0ba548",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "2809e0bf",
"en_raw": "Don't bother me"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3b7dcc51",
"en_raw": "Yahoo, girl!"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a5bd39a4",
"en_raw": "Earning experience points?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "c83afe8a",
"en_raw": "Not bad"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "acb0b4b3",
"en_raw": "Today I came to look at"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "34d9789a",
"en_raw": "those suspicious wares"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "43abd4dd",
"en_raw": "Ha ha"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "0c93321b",
"en_raw": "It really is suspicious, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "ba6c04ea",
"en_raw": "Where do they get it from?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f334a978",
"en_raw": "Well, take your time!"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "eb28ea26",
"en_raw": "Let's both work hard"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "25d4896b",
"en_raw": "at leveling up~!"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "a0b2456c",
"en_raw": "A Lizard Hand..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "d71ba55f",
"en_raw": "As expected of a customer with good taste"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "5bf0ea4f",
"en_raw": "That's a good one"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "61322be2",
"en_raw": "What is this?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "87f854d8",
"en_raw": "It's a charm"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "d7615a17",
"en_raw": "...Lately this is a popular item"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ff67a739",
"en_raw": "because someone keeps buying"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "6da90976",
"en_raw": "now's the time"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "e8594e8c",
"en_raw": "Someone who buys them all up...?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a671522d",
"en_raw": "Hey, do you remember"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "a5a9770e",
"en_raw": "what he looked like?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "ef5c1d34",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "30b25be8",
"en_raw": "What kind of person buys them..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "5345dbb7",
"en_raw": "I don't really get boys"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "eb715420",
"en_raw": "but the severity of that distortion"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "438a327d",
"en_raw": "Hey, you said he's distorted..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "31044872",
"en_raw": "You said, but..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "c2beecf8",
"en_raw": "What kind of face does he have?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ee7fb9f9",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "b23a04bb",
"en_raw": "His face too, but in his case"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "078d56ee",
"en_raw": "Character?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "bcdf6b3b",
"en_raw": "it's his character"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "724af22e",
"en_raw": "The moment he saw this item"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "baea24f0",
"en_raw": "he asked how effective it is"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2e58a8f9",
"en_raw": "so as a joke I told him"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "214f1b0a",
"en_raw": "it lowers your Armor Class by 1"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "6f3997a4",
"en_raw": "...Guess what he said?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "966da26d",
"en_raw": "He muttered, 'ignorant fool'!"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "e42a98da",
"en_raw": "That really ticked me off"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f5e982be",
"en_raw": "That phrase"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "42be3fd9",
"en_raw": "reminds me of someone..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "107b65fc",
"en_raw": "Hey, that guy"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "76ac5eab",
"en_raw": "might be someone I know..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "080c6674",
"en_raw": "Guys like that are the worst"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "12903e77",
"en_raw": "so never, even by mistake"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "22859e75",
"en_raw": "fall for one"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "7077a026",
"en_raw": "I doubt you would, though"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b0de8456",
"en_raw": "The culprit is that occult maniac"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "a50c0c56",
"en_raw": "without a doubt..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "232b2fe0",
"en_raw": "Hey, thanks for the very valuable info"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "30aa7827",
"en_raw": "I'd like to buy something"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "c7410c32",
"en_raw": "as thanks, but"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "af27fb9c",
"en_raw": "Never mind, save your money"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "f6f9af7f",
"en_raw": "This was fun for me too"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "c1f557f4",
"en_raw": "Come again~!"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "881ea4a3",
"en_raw": "Yeah, thanks"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "2d023aa9",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
}
]
}